      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mutual%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mutual once supported local newspapers like the Persimmon Valley Index, though a planned rail line for the town was never built.",
